  {
    "url": "https://of1--frescopa26--aem-showcase.aem.page/machines/atelier",
    "title": "The Atelier",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "The Atelier"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The first Fréscopa machine with a feel for your mornings. It learns what you love, reads the shape of your day, and quietly takes care of the rest."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Finish — Cream"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Free delivery, and we'll set it up for you."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Two-year workshop guarantee."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Thirty mornings to fall for it, or send it back."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "HOW IT ACTUALLY WORKS"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "It learns your taste. Here's how."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Not a preset menu, and not a guess. The Atelier works the way a good barista does — it pays attention, remembers, and adjusts. Four quiet steps, running every morning."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Grind, flow, strength, temperature."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A profile per person, refined daily."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Time, calendar, weather, who's up."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Warms up, pours, reorders."
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "It tastes every cup"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A ring of sensors watches every extraction — the grind size, how fast the water flows, the strength in the cup, and the temperature at the group head. The same signals a barista feels by hand, read hundreds of times a second."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "YOUR FLAVOUR DNA AND MORNING ROUTINES STAY ON YOUR MACHINE AND YOUR ACCOUNT. YOU CAN REVIEW WHAT IT HAS LEARNED, CORRECT IT, OR WIPE IT CLEAN, ANY TIME."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "SEE IT IN THE MORNING"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Two minutes in a real kitchen."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "THE CLAIMS, ANSWERED"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Every promise, backed up."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "From your first cup it tracks strength, temperature and milk, and settles into your preference within about a week."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "EVERY DETAIL"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "The full specification."
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "DESIGN AND BUILD"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "BREWING"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "INTELLIGENCE AND CONNECTIVITY"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "POWER AND SOUND"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "SUSTAINABILITY"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "DELIVERY AND RETURNS"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "In the box"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "The Atelier machine"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Starter bag of house beans, 250 g"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Reusable pod and scoop"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Water filter cartridge"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Quick-start card"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Power cable"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "HOW IT LEARNS YOU"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Your taste, drawn one cup at a time."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "We call the picture the Atelier builds your flavour DNA. Tap a profile to see how a Tuesday, a slow Sunday, and a late evening each pour a little differently."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Brisk and a little bolder. Enough to meet the day, never so much it rushes you."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "WHAT OWNERS SAY"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "The verdict, three months in."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "from 214 verified owners"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "BEFORE YOU DECIDE"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Every last hesitation, handled."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The small doubts that keep a good machine in its box. Here's the honest answer to each."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Ask us anything else"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Not at all. Delivery includes a full setup, so it's pouring before we leave. If anything ever feels off, we'll talk you through it."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "WAYS TO BUY"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Start with the machine, or the whole ritual."
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "The Atelier"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The machine, delivered and set up in your kitchen. Everything it needs to start learning you."
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "The Atelier + a year of beans"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The machine, plus house beans delivered as you need them for a year. It reorders; you never run dry."
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "The Atelier + Barista Kit"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Adds the milk jug, tamper, and two ceramic cups — for the mornings you want to do it by hand."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "PAIRS WELL WITH"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Stock the shelf beside it."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "COFFEE The house pour Our everyday blend, coaxed a little rounder for the season. $18 Add to cart →"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "The house pour"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Our everyday blend, coaxed a little rounder for the season."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "TEA Honeybush and orange peel Caffeine-free, and quietly sweet. Made for slowing down. $14 Add to cart →"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Honeybush and orange peel"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Caffeine-free, and quietly sweet. Made for slowing down."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "JUICE Cold-pressed citrus Three oranges, one grapefruit, and a whisper of ginger. $10 Add to cart →"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Cold-pressed citrus"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Three oranges, one grapefruit, and a whisper of ginger."
      },
