  {
    "url": "https://of1--frescopa26--aem-showcase.aem.page/cafe",
    "title": "Come taste the whole of Fréscopa.",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "THE CAFÉ & SHOWROOM"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Come taste the whole of Fréscopa."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Part coffee bar, part showroom, part gathering place. Sit with a cup, get hands-on with the machines, and stay for a class — no purchase, no pressure."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Find your nearest café→"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "See what's inside"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "WHY COME IN"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Reasons to make the trip."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Taste before you commit Flight through the coffee, tea and cold-press range at the bar. Find the cup you'll want at home."
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Taste before you commit"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Flight through the coffee, tea and cold-press range at the bar. Find the cup you'll want at home."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Meet the machines Pull a shot on the Atelier line yourself. Feel the difference before it lands on your counter."
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Meet the machines"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Pull a shot on the Atelier line yourself. Feel the difference before it lands on your counter."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Learn from the team Brewing classes, latte-art labs and cuppings led by people who do it every day."
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Learn from the team"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Brewing classes, latte-art labs and cuppings led by people who do it every day."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Somewhere to linger A warm room to meet, work, or read the morning away. Come for the coffee, stay for the quiet."
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Somewhere to linger"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A warm room to meet, work, or read the morning away. Come for the coffee, stay for the quiet."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "THE EXPERIENCE"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Three rooms, one long morning."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "01 · THE TASTE BAR"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Every drink we make, poured to order."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Sit at the bar and work through the range — espresso and slow-pour coffee, loose-leaf tea, and cold-pressed juice. Our team talks you through each one and builds a tasting flight around what you like. It's the fastest way to find your everyday cup."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Browse the coffee range→"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "02 · THE SHOWROOM"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Get your hands on the whole line."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The full Atelier range is set up and running. Pull your own shot, watch the machine learn a profile, and ask the questions a spec sheet can't answer. When you're ready, we'll help you pick the one that fits your kitchen — or arrange a home delivery."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Explore the machines→"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "03 · THE TABLE"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Learn something, meet someone."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Most evenings the long table hosts something — a brewing class, a latte-art lab, a cupping, or just a slow community morning. Classes are small and hands-on, and most are free with a drink. Check what's on below and save a seat."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "See what's on→"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "WHAT'S ON"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "This week at the table."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Free with a drink unless noted"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "TUESDAY Origins cupping Taste three single-origin lots side by side and learn to name what you taste. 6:30–7:30PM Free"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "TUESDAY"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Origins cupping"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Taste three single-origin lots side by side and learn to name what you taste."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "WEDNESDAY Latte-art lab Hands-on milk steaming and pour practice on the Atelier line. Beginners welcome. 6:00–7:30PM $15"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "WEDNESDAY"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Latte-art lab"
      },
      {
