        "tag": "p",
        "text": "BOOK AN ATELIER TOUR"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "A guided hour with the machine that learns you."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Book a free, 45-minute private tour at any showroom café. A specialist walks you through the Atelier line, dials a shot to your taste, and answers everything a spec sheet can't. No obligation to buy."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "→ 45 minutes, one-to-one with a specialist"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "→ Taste the full range, dialled to your palate"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "→ Free, and yours to book whenever suits"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "We'll confirm by email within one business day. No payment needed to book."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "COME SAY HELLO"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "The kettle's on. The door's open."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "No appointment, no pressure — just a good cup and a warm room. We'd love to see you."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Find a café→"
      },
